se","title":""}}},"block_order":["logo_4fk3RQ","logo_jJTWX4","logo_c6VCpn"],"custom_css":[".logo-list__logo {max-width: 25%; margin-left: 3%; margin-right: 3%;}","@media (min-width: 786px) {.logo-list__logo-image {width: 130px; }}"],"settings":{"title":"Explore Other Sections","image_opacity":100,"color_scheme":"default"}},"rich_text_EQfMc3":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_ibC7Nh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Shein Women's Fashion in Oman","use_h1":true}},"text_ybCtiB":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Skip the 3-week international wait. Our Muscat warehouse is fully stocked with the latest Shein women's styles, ready for 48-hour delivery across Oman. <\/p><p>Cash on delivery  ·  Easy returns  ·  Outlet prices<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_ibC7Nh","text_ybCtiB"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"height":"medium","text_alignment":"center","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"default"}},"collapsible_tabs_EHtxBq":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"question_PHWHgG":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Why Beisat is the Best Place to Shop Women's Fashion in Oman","answer":"<ul><li><strong>Local Stock, Zero Wait: <\/strong>Every dress, top, and set is already in our Muscat warehouse.<strong> <\/strong>No customs, no tracking across borders.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>48-Hour Delivery: <\/strong>Ordered today, at your door in two days, anywhere in Oman.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>Cash on Delivery: <\/strong>No cards required. Pay when you receive.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>Outlet Prices: <\/strong>The same Shein quality you love, at prices that don't hurt.<\/li><\/ul>"}},"question_LLa8Jn":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"The Smartest Way to Shop Shein Women's Clothes in Oman","answer":"<p>Let's be honest, everyone loves Shein's style. The 14-day shipping wait is the only dealbreaker. <\/p><p>We fixed that. <a href=\"https:\/\/beisat.com\/?srsltid=AfmBOopWLY5C69KtikUmUl9Pp-4BGaYWLhgfUUigOUUfj8LmGkJrJp1I\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Beisat<\/span><\/a> is a dedicated Shein women's outlet based in Muscat. We buy inventory in bulk, store it here in the Sultanate, and deliver it while the trend is still relevant. <\/p><p>Whether you are after the viral dress everyone is wearing, modest loungewear for the weekend, or activewear that actually fits, it is all here, in stock, today. <\/p><p><em><strong>Same products. Same quality. Same prices. Just delivered the way Oman deserves.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>"}},"question_jdNDDX":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Shein Women's Collection at Beisat Oman","answer":"<p>Beisat carries the full range of Shein women's fashion, not a filtered selection, not last season's leftovers. <\/p><p>We stock dresses, abayas, modest wear, tops, trousers, activewear, swimwear, loungewear, outerwear, and accessories, all sourced directly and held in our Oman warehouse. <\/p><p>Because we operate as an outlet, many pieces are available in limited quantities, often one per design. <\/p><p>That means you get something genuinely exclusive, not the same item everyone else is wearing. <\/p><p>Our platform is built for easy discovery: filter by category, browse by trend, save to your wishlist, and check out in minutes. Regular discounts, flexible payment, and a smooth mobile app experience come as standard. <\/p><p>If it is trending on Shein right now, there is a good chance it is already on our shelves in Muscat, and at your door within 48 hours.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_PHWHgG","question_LLa8Jn","question_jdNDDX"],"name":"Collapsible tabs","settings":{"title":"Read more"}}},"order":["main","rich_text_nzRTiM","rich_text_zEyLg6","slideshow_6cgEPc","countdown_timer_TAKaQi","collection_list_YzqiXa","collection_list_RWh66J","collection_list_Dty6h3","collection_list_7YdDHC","collection_list_VWdrye","featured_collection_7rnW3B","countdown_timer_nnnQj9","featured_collection_grqymT","logo_list_aQkeFW","rich_text_EQfMc3","collapsible_tabs_EHtxBq